From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:46:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: per-package validate, implemented transports only, DCO
 deferred

- S3 defines a per-workspace validate aggregated at the root; each CI
  matrix leg gates only its own package
- local-dev and the boot smoke cover each server's implemented transports
  (stdio for all; Streamable HTTP only for everything)
- DCO is deferred to the S6 maintainer decision, not N/A
- Part numbers match the retitled issues (#4472 is Part 13)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
